Daten verändert — modifications from the original distribution:
1. Tile split — the 2 km tile 690_5334 was split into four 1 km files
   (lod2_citygml/690_5334_1.gml, 690_5335_1.gml, 691_5334_1.gml,
   691_5335_1.gml) to keep files reviewable in pull requests. Building
   contents and gml:id values are unchanged by the split.
2. Ongoing collaborative edits — buildings are updated through reviewed pull
   requests; every change is recorded in the git history of this repository
   (per-building commits). docs/provenance-rules.md defines how sources are
   recorded inside the data.

